  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **kglw2024-11-16t01**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **kglw2024-11-16t02**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **kglw2024-11-16t03**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **kglw2024-11-16t04**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **kglw2024-11-16t05**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **kglw2024-11-16t06**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **kglw2024-11-16t07**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **kglw2024-11-16t08**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2024-11-16.THOR** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 129 min [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-16**: source not stated; 16 songs; 131 min [2]\n- **kglw2024-11-16.bandcampbootleg**: soundboard; 0 songs; 129 min [3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Joey played acoustic guitar during the performance of this specific track [1]\n- The song included an alternate slower outro section during the live performance [2]\n- Amby quoted Tomorrow by Silverchair before playing this song, which contained Theia teases [2]\n- Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, and Grace King recorded the show for the band [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2024-11-16.THOR**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor>PMD661>24/96wav [1]. Also: Taper Ted Chopped used a Marantz PMD661 recorder for the audio capture [1]\n- **kglw2024-11-16**: taped by discocape; transferred by discocape; source: Schoeps cmc1k/mk21's [2]. Also: Discocape handled the taping, tracking, and transferring using Schoeps mics and a MixPre 6ii [2]\n- **kglw2024-11-16.bandcampbootleg**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Poster For Show In Houston Texas At White Oak Music Hall On November 16 2024 Home Dec](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-poster-for-show-in-houston-texas-at-white-oak-music-hall-on-november-16-2024-home-decor-poster-canvas/) [5]\n- Poster by Reverholic: [King Gizzard And The Lizard Wizard Poster For Show In Houston Texas At White Oak Music Hall On November 16 2024 Unisex T](https://reverholic.com/product/king-gizzard-and-the-lizard-wizard-poster-for-show-in-houston-texas-at-white-oak-music-hall-on-november-16-2024-unisex-t-shirt/) [6]",
